Attribution
-----------
This project builds an inference orchestration layer around models and ideas from
the upstream MAPLE project:

  MAPLE: Manifold-Activated Pruning of Latent Experts for Sub-2-BPW MoE LLMs
  Author: Aman Sachan
  Repository: https://github.com/AmSach/maple   (Apache License 2.0)
  Upstream commit referenced when this project was created:
      5403b6f5ec3f904409d968ff6a3ea3a2b22767d1  (2026-11-19)
  DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.24344372

The upstream repository's source files are NOT copied into this project. Only
the upstream LICENSE text is reproduced (unchanged) as required for Apache-2.0
attribution. The MAPLE model files (GGUF) are produced and published by the
upstream author and are used here as external, read-only inputs; they are not
distributed with this project.

MAPLE-llama.cpp is an independent project. It is not an official fork, release or continuation of the upstream
repository and is not endorsed by its authors. A source comparison on 2026-11-20 found no upstream source code in this
repository; only the Apache-2.0 license text is shared.

Changes relative to upstream: this is a new codebase. The upstream Ollama-based
router and its Bonsai integration were intentionally NOT carried over; there is
no Bonsai dependency or runtime component anywhere in this project.

